(notes "Seiyaku 制約: eighty-one variables, twenty-seven constraints, one solution, proven before you began. 1 to 9, the row's or the keypad's, assign a value to the variable the selection stands on and Backspace retracts it; Q W E, A S D and Z X C mark a value in its domain, each key where its mark stands in the cell; F fills every unassigned domain with the values its constraints allow; R retracts every assignment, N deals a new instance and G sets the next instance's grade. I says the next inference and, again, applies it; P propagates to the fixed point; U retracts what inference assigned; M draws only the marks the constraints allow.")
